#: ../../../netlink/specs/gtp.yaml:3
msgid "GPRS Tunnelling Protocol, user plane (GTP-U)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../netlink/specs/gtp.yaml:3
msgid ""
"The gtp netdevice encapsulates and decapsulates user plane packets in GTP-U "
"tunnels (GTPv0 and GTPv1-U, see 3GPP TS 29.060 and TS 29.281). This family "
"manages the PDP contexts that describe the tunnels and triggers GTP-U echo "
"requests. It is driven by user space control planes such as those built on "
"libgtpnl."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../netlink/specs/gtp.yaml:3
msgid ""
"The kernel registers the family with version 0, which the genetlink-legacy "
"schema cannot express."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../netlink/specs/gtp.yaml:3
msgid ""
"The notifications multicast on the \"gtp\" group are not described: PDP "
"context additions and deletions, and GTP-U echo responses, reuse the NEWPDP, "
"DELPDP and ECHOREQ command values of the requests."
msgstr ""

